# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Frontend environment configuration (Vite).
# Copy to `.env.local` for local overrides, or set in the Render dashboard.
# NEVER commit real secrets. This file documents the KEYS only.
#
# NOTE: Vite inlines these at BUILD time. On Render, set them on the static
# site service so they are present during `npm run build`.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------

# Base URL of the FastAPI backend (no trailing slash).
# - Local development: leave UNSET. The app then calls same-origin `/api`,
#   which the Vite dev server proxies to http://127.0.0.1:8000 (vite.config.js).
# - Production: set to the deployed backend origin.
# VITE_API_URL=https://your-backend-service.onrender.com
